sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant GH as GitHub PR
    participant CI as GitHub Actions
    participant State as prod manifest.json
    participant DBT as dbt
    participant DevSchema as ephemeral dev schema

    Dev->>GH: opens PR with model change
    GH->>CI: trigger workflow
    CI->>State: download prod/manifest.json
    CI->>DBT: dbt deps
    CI->>DBT: dbt parse (smoke test)
    CI->>DBT: dbt list --select state:modified+ --state prod/
    DBT-->>CI: 3 modified + 5 downstream
    CI->>DBT: dbt build --select state:modified+ --defer --state prod/
    DBT->>State: defer --state prod/ (use prod tables for unmodified models)
    DBT->>DevSchema: build only modified models in ephemeral schema
    DevSchema-->>DBT: build complete
    CI->>Dev: green check (or red with logs)
    Dev->>GH: merge PR after approval
